  "description": "The grass/fern/reed/rush species world/sources/flora/groundcover.json binds to painted ground (T3 runtime ring, module 65 \u00a7110). Kept separate from flora-province-v1 so the ring renderer loads a few hundred KB, not the 12 MB tree kit, before the ground can dress. No LOD chain: these are 3\u2013128-triangle alpha cards drawn only inside a ~75 m ring, so decimation would only shred the cutouts. Textures capped at 256 px like the flora kit (ships to GitHub Pages). Round 13 (decision 0048) took the ring from 7 meshes to 34 so no one mesh carries three land covers; the triangle ceiling of 128 is the shipped seven's own maximum and every addition measures at or under it.",
